{"data":{"body":"**P3 \u2014 Preserve plugin identities in conflict errors.** `getSimpleName()` is empty for anonymous subclasses, including those created in `existingSubclassGroupMethodsRemainCompatible`, so failures report `Conflicting plugins  and  ...`. Use `getName()` or fall back to it when the simple name is empty, and assert the diagnostic in that test.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc75xK4u","finding_digest":"07ee73f74618c7c18c6de752d8f4b998e40ea2e68259cfb9e6acc35696c08420","finding_id":"arf_v1_a7xhh52gddd4dddn45jnr5fztd","finding_key":"sdk/plugin/pluginrunner::validateexclusivegroups::anonymous-plugin-diagnostic","identity_key":"sdk/plugin/pluginrunner::validateexclusivegroups::anonymous-plugin-diagnostic","line":44,"observation_digest":"1f161fb716e6276e9d1aea03312a2d5c198243b1d2b06136dcfce37776d83ca1","observation_id":"aro_v1_d4lb7nyw4ytw5hi25ibtckrnlq","path":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/plugin/PluginRunner.java","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_a7xhh52gddd4dddn45jnr5fztd","published_at":"2026-10-06T00:51:01Z","review_id":"arr_v1_zb7plygxc2z7r3acm762poiys5","reviewed_base_sha":"ac6a6f5ea50d6a9098b716905f01c609e4c201ae","reviewed_head_sha":"97166ec7ecc41bd3acf5c13c1fa2c597086d785e","reviewer":"codex","start_line":43,"suggestion_id":"arsg_v1_mn2ewwm5clh5brp5nkayxjsciy"},"pull_request":{"number":766},"record_id":"art_v1_4ypurf574j2yyw3xgxx6oiuljn","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-06T00:51:01Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
